Budget-vs-actual dashboard data dictionary


SHEET: Fields
One row per unit/department/month. Amounts in USD thousands (USD 000).
Field | Type | Rule
unit | text | EAST or WEST
department | text | Required
period | YYYY-MM | One period per file
currency | text | USD only
budget | number | USD 000, required
actual | number | USD 000, required
key | derived | unit + department + period must be unique

SHEET: Metrics
Metric | Definition
Variance | actual − budget
Variance % | (actual − budget) ÷ budget
Unit total | Sum over departments for the selected unit

SHEET: Expected totals
Use these to check your dashboard.
File | Filter | Budget | Actual | Variance
september.json | All | 350 | 360 | 10
september.json | EAST | 180 | 180 | 0
september.json | WEST | 170 | 180 | 10
october.json | All | 220 | 220 | 0
october.json | EAST | 100 | 105 | 5
october.json | WEST | 120 | 115 | -5

Northstar Services is a fictional company. All names, figures, and dates are training material.
